2690	// 解析整个 iCalendar 文件；任何结构错误、关键属性重复或缺失都抛出 BizError（整批失败）
2691	function parseIcalFile(text: string, file: string): IcalEvent[] {
2692	  const bad = (reason: string): never => {
2693	    throw new BizError(`iCalendar 文件 ${file} 无法导入：${reason}（整批未导入，数据未改动）`);
2694	  };
2695	  const lines = unfoldIcalLines(text, bad);
2696	  if (lines.length === 0) bad('文件为空');
2697	
2698	  const events: IcalEvent[] = [];
2699	  const seenUids = new Set<string>();
2700	  let inCalendar = false;
2701	  let calendarEnded = false;
2702	  let versionSeen = false;
2703	  let inEvent = false;
2704	  let curUid: string | undefined;
2705	  let curStart: {raw: string; min: number} | undefined;
2706	  let curEnd: {raw: string; min: number} | undefined;
2707	
2708	  const closeEvent = (): void => {
2709	    if (curUid === undefined) bad('VEVENT 缺少 UID 属性');
2710	    if (curStart === undefined) bad(`VEVENT（UID “${curUid}”）缺少 DTSTART 属性`);
2711	    if (curEnd === undefined) bad(`VEVENT（UID “${curUid}”）缺少 DTEND 属性`);
2712	    if (curEnd.min <= curStart.min) {
2713	      bad(`VEVENT（UID “${curUid}”）结束时间必须晚于开始时间（${curStart.raw} → ${curEnd.raw}），允许跨日`);
2714	    }
2715	    if (seenUids.has(curUid)) bad(`文件内 UID 重复: “${curUid}”（解码后区分大小写）`);
2716	    seenUids.add(curUid);
2717	    events.push({
2718	      uid: curUid,
2719	      startRaw: curStart.raw,
2720	      endRaw: curEnd.raw,
2721	      startMin: curStart.min,
2722	      endMin: curEnd.min,
2723	    });
2724	    inEvent = false;
2725	    curUid = undefined;
2726	    curStart = undefined;
2727	    curEnd = undefined;
2728	  };
2729	
2730	  for (const line of lines) {
2731	    const {name, params, value} = parseContentLine(line, bad);
2732	
2733	    if (name === 'BEGIN') {
2734	      const comp = value.trim().toUpperCase();
2735	      if (calendarEnded) bad('END:VCALENDAR 之后仍有内容');
2736	      if (!inCalendar) {
2737	        if (comp !== 'VCALENDAR') bad(`顶层组件必须是 VCALENDAR，实际为 “${value.trim()}”`);
2738	        inCalendar = true;
2739	      } else if (!inEvent) {
2740	        if (comp !== 'VEVENT') bad(`不支持的组件 “${value.trim()}”（仅接受 VEVENT）`);
2741	        inEvent = true;
2742	        curUid = undefined;
2743	        curStart = undefined;
2744	        curEnd = undefined;
2745	      } else {
2746	        bad(`事件内不允许嵌套组件 “${value.trim()}”（如 VALARM）`);
2747	      }
2748	      continue;
2749	    }
2750	    if (name === 'END') {
2751	      const comp = value.trim().toUpperCase();
2752	      if (!inCalendar) bad('END 出现在 BEGIN:VCALENDAR 之前');
2753	      if (inEvent) {
2754	        if (comp !== 'VEVENT') bad(`END:${value.trim()} 与 BEGIN:VEVENT 不匹配`);
2755	        closeEvent();
2756	      } else {
2757	        if (comp !== 'VCALENDAR') bad(`END:${value.trim()} 没有匹配的 BEGIN`);
2758	        inCalendar = false;
2759	        calendarEnded = true;
2760	      }
2761	      continue;
2762	    }
2763	
2764	    if (calendarEnded) bad('END:VCALENDAR 之后仍有内容');
2765	    if (!inCalendar) bad(`属性 “${name}” 出现在 BEGIN:VCALENDAR 之前`);
2766	
2767	    if (!inEvent) {
2768	      // 日历级属性：VERSION 必须恰为 2.0；METHOD:CANCEL 为取消事件，拒绝
2769	      if (name === 'VERSION') {
2770	        if (versionSeen) bad('VERSION 属性重复');
2771	        versionSeen = true;
2772	        if (value.trim() !== '2.0') bad(`仅支持 VERSION:2.0，实际为 “${value.trim()}”`);
2773	      } else if (name === 'METHOD' && value.trim().toUpperCase() === 'CANCEL') {
2774	        bad('取消事件（METHOD:CANCEL）不支持导入');
2775	      }
2776	      // 其余日历级属性（PRODID、CALSCALE 等）忽略
2777	      continue;
2778	    }
2779	
2780	    // 事件内属性
2781	    switch (name) {
2782	      case 'UID': {
2783	        if (curUid !== undefined) bad(`VEVENT 内 UID 属性重复（首个为 “${curUid}”）`);
2784	        const uid = unescapeIcalText(value);
2785	        if (uid === '') bad('VEVENT 的 UID 不能为空');
2786	        curUid = uid;
2787	        break;
2788	      }
2789	      case 'DTSTART': {
2790	        if (curStart !== undefined) bad('VEVENT 内 DTSTART 属性重复');
2791	        assertFloatingDateTimeParams(params, 'DTSTART ', bad);
2792	        curStart = parseIcalDateTime(value.trim(), 'DTSTART ', bad);
2793	        break;
2794	      }
2795	      case 'DTEND': {
2796	        if (curEnd !== undefined) bad('VEVENT 内 DTEND 属性重复');
2797	        assertFloatingDateTimeParams(params, 'DTEND ', bad);
2798	        curEnd = parseIcalDateTime(value.trim(), 'DTEND ', bad);
2799	        break;
2800	      }
2801	      case 'STATUS': {
2802	        if (value.trim().toUpperCase() === 'CANCELLED') {
2803	          bad('取消事件（STATUS:CANCELLED）不支持导入');
2804	        }
2805	        break;
2806	      }
2807	      case 'DESCRIPTION':
2808	        break; // 描述属性忽略
2809	      default:
2810	        if (ICAL_RECURRENCE_PROPS.has(name)) {
2811	          bad(`不支持重复相关属性 ${name}（不导入重复事件）`);
2812	        }
2813	        // 其余属性（SUMMARY、LOCATION、DTSTAMP、SEQUENCE 等）忽略
2814	    }
2815	  }
2816	
2817	  if (inEvent) bad('VEVENT 缺少对应的 END:VEVENT');
2818	  if (inCalendar) bad('VCALENDAR 缺少对应的 END:VCALENDAR');
2819	  if (!versionSeen) bad('缺少 VERSION:2.0 属性');
2820	  if (events.length === 0) bad('VCALENDAR 中没有任何 VEVENT（至少需要一个独立事件）');
2821	  return events;
2822	}
